# Grafana Alerting — Discord Webhook
# 1. Go to Discord Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook
# 2. Copy the URL
# 3. Replace the placeholder:
#
#   sed -i "s|YOUR_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL|https://discord.com/api/webhooks/YOUR_ACTUAL_HOOK|" docker/grafana-contactpoints.yml
#
# 4. Restart Grafana:
#
#   sg docker -c "docker compose -p realtor restart grafana"
